[{"title":"得外舅安丰董先生书","author":"于谦","text":"悠悠远别几经年，极目江南思渺然。\n客底正劳千里梦，天边忽堕五云笺。\n得官自愧超迁早，济世深惭学术偏。\n瞻仰泰山应未遂，马蹄明日又翩翩。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":32074,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送中书舍人内弟董仲鲁奉使亲藩","author":"于谦","text":"奉使亲藩属俊才，宁亲此日遂归来。\n天涯游子十年别，堂上慈颜一笑开。\n北阙风云新节钺，西湖烟雨旧楼台。\n痴儿相见应相问，好带平安两字来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":32075,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"挽兵部柴尚书","author":"于谦","text":"权兼将相竭忠诚，文武全才属老成。\n廊庙雍容时望重，边陲谈笑战尘清。\n白鸡忽忆当年梦，青史应垂万古名。\n嗟我忝居乡曲后，谩歌楚些寄哀情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":32076,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"悼内六首 其一","author":"于谦","text":"垂老光阴两鬓皤，细君弃我竟如何。\n夫妻一旦世缘尽，儿女百年恩爱多。\n晓阁空悬台上镜，春衣谁试箧中罗。\n客边闻讣肠先断，泪落西风鼓缶歌。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":32077,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"悼内六首 其二","author":"于谦","text":"世缘情爱总成空，二十馀年一梦中。\n疏广未能辞汉主，孟光先已弃梁鸿。\n镫昏罗幔通宵雨，花谢雕阑蓦地风。\n欲觅音容在何处，九原无路辨西东。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":32078,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"悼内六首 其三","author":"于谦","text":"缥缈音容何处寻，乱山重叠暮云深。\n四千里外还家梦，二十年前结发心。\n寂寞青灯形对影，萧疏白发泪沾襟。\n箧中空有遗书在，把玩不堪成古今。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":32079,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"悼内六首 其四","author":"于谦","text":"尘寰冥路两茫茫，何处青山认故乡。\n破镜已分鸾凤影，遗衣空带麝兰香。\n梦回孤馆肠千结，愁对残灯泪万行。\n抱痛苦嫌胸次窄，也应无处著凄凉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":32080,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"悼内六首 其五","author":"于谦","text":"东风庭院落花飞，偕老齐眉愿竟违。\n幻梦一番生与死，讣音千里是耶非。\n凄凉怀抱几时歇，缥缈音容何处归。\n魂断九泉招不得，客边一日几沾衣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":32081,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"悼内六首 其六","author":"于谦","text":"房栊寂寞掩春风，百岁情缘一旦空。\n世态不离生死内，梦魂都在别离中。\n可怜孤馆月华白，犹忆香奁烛影红。\n老眼昏昏数行泪，客边从此恨无穷。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":32082,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送顾克新南还","author":"于谦","text":"都门三月柳飞花，把酒相看日未斜。\n充贡已看先得意，承恩仍喜蚤还家。\n轻风细浪征帆稳，芳草长亭客路赊。\n君去故园春尚好，令人归思满天涯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":32083,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春阴感怀","author":"于谦","text":"连日轻阴雨未成，万株烟柳暗春城。\n野花偏向愁边发，池草多从梦里生。\n越水吴山频引领，沈腰潘鬓不胜情。\n何时归去西湖路，载酒携柑听早莺。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":32084,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"重阳感怀","author":"于谦","text":"昼景如梭夜漏长，又惊节序是重阳。\n江枫点缀秋光好，篱菊包藏晚节香。\n多事未容陶令去，老怀难学孟嘉狂。\n萧条孤馆谁相问，独对西风一举觞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":32085,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"新年客怀","author":"于谦","text":"客底光阴似水流，又看五十五春秋。\n深惭一品三孤秩，敢望千金万户侯。\n辇路尘清残雪在，御炉香煖瑞烟浮。\n老来况味俱萧索，只有归心不自由。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":32086,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"暮秋感怀","author":"于谦","text":"重阳节后北风多，景物萧条可奈何。\n叶带寒声风外落，雁随霜信月中过。\n愁来万事纷如结，老去孤忠耿不磨。\n偷得浮生片时暇，凭阑搔首且吟哦。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":32087,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"元日述怀","author":"于谦","text":"锡宴归来静掩扉，卧看初日转斜晖。\n避喧不欲轮蹄驻，得食从教鸟雀飞。\n远道冰霜情脉脉，故园梅柳思依依。\n新年祝愿无他事，惟乞皇恩早赐归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":32088,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"王一宁学士哀挽","author":"于谦","text":"内相方承宠渥新，那堪鵩鸟集承尘。\n文章功业成千古，台阁丝纶少一人。\n慷慨谁论天下事，凄凉空忆梦中身。\n向时谈笑皆陈迹，惟有临风泪满巾。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":32089,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"直庐岁暮","author":"于谦","text":"直庐萧索度残年，静夜焚香思悄然。\n市远不知沽酒价，庭空惟见煮茶烟。\n风穿疏牖银灯暗，月转高城玉漏传。\n归兴渐随生意动，昨宵清梦绕林泉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":32090,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送知县莫文渊致仕归钱塘","author":"于谦","text":"解组还乡未白头，身安意适复何求。\n六桥有路閒来往，万事无心任去留。\n阖境吏民思旧泽，入门儿女具新篘。\n明朝我亦休官去，同向西湖理钓舟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":32091,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送江用亨下第","author":"于谦","text":"贾生年少负奇才，射策无成又独回。\n威凤不随凡鸟语，好花偏向暮春开。\n都门烟树关情远，故国湖山入梦来。\n浪暖桃香三载后，禹门还听一声雷。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":32092,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和何知州交趾死节韵","author":"于谦","text":"凛凛英风震百蛮，巍巍砥柱屹狂澜。\n自缘忠义存心正，不惜从容就死难。\n瘴海云迷归路远，边城月照旅魂单。\n衣间别有文山句，千载令人拭泪看。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":32093,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送道士史志中","author":"于谦","text":"不驾青牛西出关，却乘画鹢向南还。\n枕中鸿宝千金秘，袖里龙光一剑閒。\n潞水蓟门分别处，岸花樯燕送留间。\n蓬莱到日春将老，想见碧桃开满山。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":32094,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"豫让桥怀古","author":"于谦","text":"豫让桥边策马过，当年意气未消磨。\n人臣报主宜如此，死不成功可奈何。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":32095,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"列石挽窦鸣犊","author":"于谦","text":"列国难逢世主贤，孤忠非命亦堪怜。\n临河不返宣尼辙，未必声名万古传。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":32096,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"晓发太原","author":"于谦","text":"鸣驺拥道出边城，月澹星疏骑火明。\n驿路经行三十里，漏声犹自报残更。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":32097,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过汜水睹曾典史所种树感怀一绝","author":"于谦","text":"化洽民心久未忘，路旁嘉树比甘棠。\n我来憩马清阴下，泪洒薰风一断肠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":32098,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过荥阳","author":"于谦","text":"鸿沟迢递接荥阳，芳草瀰漫古战场。\n说尽兴亡无限事，数声啼鸟在垂杨。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":32099,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过汜水","author":"于谦","text":"清汜垂虹贯浊流，崤函虎踞瞰中州。\n山河不尽登临兴，两袖春风独倚楼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":32100,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"横望巡检司","author":"于谦","text":"独倚危谯拭远眸，青山环合白云浮。\n孤标中断分南北，半是覃怀半泽州。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":32101,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"读王荆公赵清献公文集","author":"于谦","text":"新法殃民众欲除，金陵强辨欲何如。\n等閒一语锋铓折，稷契当年岂读书。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":32102,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"村舍桃花","author":"于谦","text":"野水萦纡石径斜，荜门蓬户两三家。\n短墙不解遮春意，露出绯桃半树花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":32103,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夜坐","author":"于谦","text":"朦朦淡月映窗纱，坐听严城动鼓笳。\n自是归期难准信，生憎银烛又开花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":32104,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题孟浩然踏雪寻梅","author":"于谦","text":"满头风雪路欹斜，杖屦行寻卖酒家。\n万里溪山同一色，不知何处是梅花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":32105,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"梦中作","author":"于谦","text":"青鸾稳驾紫云车，天上归来月欲斜。\n吹断玉笙人去远，瑶池开遍碧桃花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":32106,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"除夜宿太原寒甚","author":"于谦","text":"寄语阳和及蚤来，何须堤柳与江梅。\n五更月落天鸡唱，更有城头画角催。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":32107,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"元日寓太原分司独坐感怀","author":"于谦","text":"客中况味似枯禅，岁月无情任转迁。\n不是五更闻爆竹，那知今日是新年。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":32108,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty"